    "Name": "Wasp",
    "Details": "Quicsell's Light Ballistic Brawler. Toughest 20 ton mech around. What it lacks in firepower, it makes up for in staying power, with more armor than many medium mechs more than double the weight. Armed with a rotary ultra-light rifle, two Quicsell machineguns, and a one ton mech grenade.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Extended Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.95</color></b>",
